SUMMARY:NASA Space Apps Challenge 2026
DESCRIPTION:A two-day global hackathon where teams use open space and Earth data to solve challenges set by NASA and its partner agencies. Hundreds of local events run worldwide\, and there is a virtual option for anyone without a local event. Details: https://swabud.tech/opportunities/nasa-space-apps-challenge-2026.html
